messages ({(["id":116,"title":"About Unknow","body":"To all Scholars....
  The Old Unknow is: No check Mob's Defense Bonus. So Strong 
is strong, weak is weak... And If msg out -> 100% hit.
Now: Check Mob's defense bonus: 100% - 50% random and maybe cant hit
or 穿透 armor.... So Even Last (5) maybe damage less than (1) bcz Defense Bonus
And other check.... 
  Now I am finding any new Gonfu for Scholars. Thank you for your 忍耐。
                                                           -Kyoko.
